    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the Magic Well to enter the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, fight unique ink monsters and become a wizard who gathered all the wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/5be8da4e0f748a76f34c08ee2aaa1216.poster.avif?t=1753111226\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/5be8da4e0f748a76f34c08ee2aaa1216.webm?t=1753111226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/5be8da4e0f748a76f34c08ee2aaa1216.mp4?t=1753111226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/0e60259ba523b14a524b9aa0989117e4.avif?t=1753111226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d533358abc3072a6917fff5afe19de06.avif?t=1753111226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each run, you will be able to unlock new items and rooms that will appear in the dungeon. Level up your character to face the new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the Magic Well to enter the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, fight unique ink monsters and become a wizard who gathered all the wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/5be8da4e0f748a76f34c08ee2aaa1216.poster.avif?t=1753111226\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/5be8da4e0f748a76f34c08ee2aaa1216.webm?t=1753111226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/5be8da4e0f748a76f34c08ee2aaa1216.mp4?t=1753111226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/0e60259ba523b14a524b9aa0989117e4.avif?t=1753111226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d533358abc3072a6917fff5afe19de06.avif?t=1753111226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each run, you will be able to unlock new items and rooms that will appear in the dungeon. Level up your character to face the new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Craft your weapon. Uncover synergies. Unleash your creativity. Wish Me Well is a weapon building roguelite dungeon crawler. Jump into the Magic Well to fight unique ink monsters in your own way!",
